      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu matuku au disama dikole diakakuata Hezikiya, diakamutonda; Yeshaya muprofete, muana wa Amoza, wakalua kudiye, wakamuambila ne, Yehowa udi wamba ne, Ulongolole nsubu webe, bualu bua wewe neufue, kuena wikala ne muoyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe yeye wakakudimuna mpala wandi ku tshimanu tshia nsubu, wakatendelela Yehowa, wakamba ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa, ndi nkusengelela ne, Uvuluke bu munakuenda ku mpala kuebe mu bushuwa ne mutshima mutoke, nakuenza malu mimpe ku mesu kuebe. Hezikiya wakatamba kudila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku diambedi Yeshaya kayi muanze kumuka ku tshiendedi, dî dia Yehowa diakalua kudiye ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walukile, Wambile Hezikiya, mukelenge wa bantu banyi, ne, Yehowa, Nzambi wa Davidi tatu webe, udi wamba ne, Nakunvua kulomba kuebe ne nakutangila binsonshi biebe, nenkuondahe; hahita matuku asatu, wewe neubuele mu nsubu wa Yehowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nenkumbashe matuku ebe tô bidimu dikumi ne bitanu; nenkusungile ne musoko eu mu bianza bia mukelenge wa Ashû, nensungile musoko eu bualu buanyi ne bua muntu wanyi Davidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeshaya wakamba ne, Wenze tshiata tshia mamuma a nfigi, batshiteke ha tshiuja, bua yeye asangale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezikiya wakebesha Yeshaya ne, Nempete tshimanyinu kai bua ne Yehowa neangondahe, ne nembuele mu nsubu wa Yehowa hahita matuku asatu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeshaya wakamuambila ne, Etshi ntshimanyinu tshia Yehowa kudi bua kukutuisha ne, Yehowa nênze bualu ebu buakuambeye: mundidimbi neuye ku mpala biendedi dikumi, anyi neuhingane biendedi dikumi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezikiya wakamba ne, Mbualu bukese bua mundidimbi uye ku mpala biendedi dikumi; mbimpe mundidimbi uhingane biendedi dikumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeshaya muprofete wakadila kudi Yehowa, yeye wakahingisha mundidimbi wakamana kuhueka ku tshibandilu tshia diba tshia Ahaza ku nyima biendedi dikumi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku tshikondo atshi Melodaka-baladana, muana wa Baladana, mukelenge wa Babulona, wakatumina Hezikiya mikanda ne bintu, bualu bua yeye wakunvua lumu ne, Hezikiya wakadi ne disama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezikiya wakunvua mei a bantu aba, wakabalesha bintu bionso bia mu bibutshilu biandi, bintu bia argent ne bia or ne bintu bia muhuya muimpe ne manyi a mushinga mukole ne nsubu wa bintu biandi bia nvita ne bintu bionso biakadiye nʼabi; Hezikiya kakabenga bua kubalesha bintu bionso bia mu nsubu wandi ne mu bukelenge buandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe Yeshaya muprofete wakafika kudi Hezikiya mukelenge, wakamuebesha ne, Bantu aba bakuamba tshinyi? Bobo bakafuma kudi kunyi? Hezikiya wakamuambila ne, Bakafuma ku buloba budi kule, ku Babulona mene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakamuebesha ne, Bakatangila bintu kai mu nsubu webe? Hezikiya wakamuambila ne, Bakatangila bintu bionso bia mu nsubu wanyi; kakuena tshintu tshimue tshia mu bintu bianyi tshinakahanga kubalesha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeshaya wakambila Hezikiya ne, Unvue biebe dî dia Yehowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu matuku alualua ku nyima bintu bionso bidi mu nsubu webe ne bintu bionso biakabutshila batatuʼebe mu musoko eu, nebiye mu Babulona. Yehowa udi Wamba ne, Nansha tshintu tshimue netshishale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebayeku ne bana bebe ba balume baudi ulela; nebikale bantu batungula mu nsubu wa mukelenge wa Babulona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe Hezikiya wakambila Yeshaya ne, Dî dia Yehowa diwakungambila ndimpe. Wakamba kabidi ne, Kakuena bualu, bikalaku ditalala kakuyi ditshina mu matuku andi nshala ne muoyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bienzedi bia Hezikiya bikuabo ne bukole buandi buonso ne bu muakumbuleye dina dinene ne mitubu bia kutuma mai munda mua musoko, kabiena bifunda mu mukanda wa kulondolola kua malu a bakelenge ba Yuda, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezikiya wakalala tulu ne bankambua bandi; Manashe, muanʼandi mulume, wakakokesha mu muaba wandi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
